# Five zones, two styles of war. Blue raids: raiders and scouts, three
# transporters, packs of raiders landing in red's zones; from the south it
# rushes instead. Red brings siege guns behind tanks, and at the centre,
# its front, it digs in. Any preset can be tuned field by field (see
# src/bot.h), for one zone or all of them. (A home that digs in never sends
# its army out: red as a turtle at home loses everything else.)
port 7700
zone west   0.12 0.5  home blue
zone north  0.4  0.08
zone south  0.4  0.92
zone centre 0.62 0.5
zone east   0.88 0.5  home red
link west north
link west south
link north centre
link south centre
link centre east
link north south
doctrine blue raider
doctrine blue in south rush
doctrine red siege
doctrine red in centre turtle garrison=20 assault_army=60
